<title>INDIA: DATES - Results of key Indian firms due this week.</title>
<headline>DATES - Results of key Indian firms due this week.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The results of the following Indian companies for the year 1996/97 (April-March) are due this week:</p>
<p>ACC			    June 18</p>
<p>BPL			    June 18</p>
<p>GEC Alsthom		  June 18</p>
<p>India Cements		June 18</p>
<p>Oriental Bank		June 18</p>
<p>Timex Watches		June 18</p>
<p>Hi-Tech Drilling	   June 19</p>
<p>SBI			    June 19</p>
<p>Shriram Honda		June 19</p>
<p>Finolex Cables	     June 20</p>
<p>Madras Refineries	  June 21</p>
<p>Mukand			 June 20</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 9000</p>
